<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Translation Ready for Review</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #28a745; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; }
        .success { background: #d4edda; border: 1px solid #c3e6cb; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>✅ Translation Complete</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Your Translation is Ready for Review</h2>
            
            <div class="success">
                <strong>🎉 SUCCESS:</strong> Your translation request has been completed and is ready for your review!
            </div>
            
            <h3>Request Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Request ID:</strong> {{request.id}}</li>
                <li><strong>Description:</strong> {{request.description}}</li>
                <li><strong>Status:</strong> {{request.status}}</li>
                <li><strong>Review Deadline:</strong> {{reviewDeadline}}</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
            <ol>
                <li>Review the translated files in your project</li>
                <li>Approve the translation if satisfied</li>
                <li>Request revisions if needed</li>
            </ol>
            
            <p><strong>Important:</strong> You have until {{reviewDeadline}} to review and approve the translation. If no action is taken, the translation will be automatically approved.</p>
            
            <p>Please log into your account to review the completed work.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from HereToTranslate</p>
            <p>Please do not reply to this email</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
